{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383320/extras/Logo_One-removebg-preview_enhanced__1_.png?t=1737566162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383320/extras/gif1.gif?t=1737566162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About This Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version of <strong><i>Dr. Yaga Lost House</i></strong> offers an exciting glimpse into the eerie and mysterious world of the full game. In this demo, you will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the Opening Levels</strong>: Experience the first chapter, uncovering the origins of the haunted house and its connection to Dr. Yaga.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Engage in Puzzle Mechanics</strong>: Solve a selection of challenging puzzles that set the stage for the full game\u2019s intricate gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Encounter Atmospheric Horror</strong>: Get a taste of the unsettling environment with spine-chilling sound design and visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Playtime</strong>: Play approximately 05 minutes of gameplay, designed to showcase the story and mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383320/extras/Logo_One-removebg-preview_enhanced.png?t=1737566162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383320/extras/gif3.gif?t=1737566162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note, this demo is a condensed experience to give players an idea of what to expect in the full game. It does not include the complete story, advanced gameplay mechanics, or additional locations featured in the full version.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3383320?t=1737566162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3383320?t=1737566162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383320/ba4656ab7f5b626afa2f2a3f671f34a460050a75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737566162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383320/ba4656ab7f5b626afa2f2a3f671f34a460050a75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737566162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Horror Elements: The game is designed to evoke fear and tension through its dark and eerie atmosphere. It includes jump scares, disturbing imagery, and scenes that may be unsettling for sensitive players.\r\n\r\nCult and Supernatural Themes: The storyline involves a malevolent cult and supernatural occurrences, which may include rituals and other disturbing activities.\r\n\r\nPsychological Horror: The game includes elements of psychological horror, which can affect players' mental and emotional states."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383320/extras/Logo_One-removebg-preview_enhanced__1_.png?t=1737566162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3383320/extras/gif1.gif?t=1737566162\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About This Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version of <strong><i>Dr. Yaga Lost House</i></strong> offers an exciting glimpse into